      "text": "⛔️TRAFFIC ADVISORY - FENWAY PARK:\nHozier Concerts – Mon & Tue, June 23-24\nFor public safety and logistical needs of the concerts several temporary parking restrictions will need to be implemented.\nParking restrictions will be in place throughout Monday and Tuesday on the following streets:\nBrookline Ave - Both sides from Overland to Lansdowne\nOverland St - South side (even side), from Brookline Ave to Beacon\nBoylston St - South side from opposite Ipswich, near Fenway Park, to Brookline Ave\nLansdowne St - Both sides, from Brookline Ave to Ipswich\nIpswich St - North side (Fenway Park side), from Lansdowne to Boylston\nVan Ness St - Both sides, from Ipswich to Kilmarnock\nRichard B Ross Way - Both sides, from Van Ness to Boylston",
